🇺🇸 \n- [@jasmineluna222#5328](/episodes/500-discord-edition/#jasmine-luna) - Canada 🇨🇦\n- [@Datsunn#9889](/episodes/500-discord-edition/#datsuun) - Windsor, Canada 🇨🇦\n- [@hiimjae#7572](/episodes/500-discord-edition/#jae-doug) -\n- [@SAINT ANGELO#9693](/episodes/500-discord-edition/#saint-angelo) - \n\n\nArtwork by [@bosourd#1456](https://www.instagram.com/bosourd/) [SC](https://soundcloud.com/bosourd)\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":21600,"location":"UN","published_at":"2021-04-10T14:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Jae Doug","position":6}},{"id":"c4zQlYvgJ5o","position":4,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Michael Jackson - Remember The Time (Louis La Roche Remix)","track":{"id":"3nm8ofskdXs","path":"/artists/michael-jackson/tracks/remember-the-time-louis-la-roche-remix/","slug":"remember-the-time-louis-la-roche-remix","title":"Remember The Time (Louis La Roche Remix)","artist":{"slug":"michael-jackson","title":"Michael Jackson"},"artwork":"images/artists/michael-jackson/tracks/remember-the-time-louis-la-roche-remix.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"U3ckiXHBqgw","slug":"147","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-147-w-dj"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #147 w/ DJ Nobody","artwork":"/images/episodes/147.jpg","content":"We have Low End Theory's very own DJ Nobody in the studio with us. \n\n<!--more-->\nWe hope you're ready for not just another great session of musical selections but also a great 25+ minute discussion between DJ Nobody and Joe Kay. \nJoe kicked things off for a little over an hour & 33 minutes with new and forgotten gems. \n\nDo your research! Nobody made his 1st appearance on the show that was well overdue and went into a heavy/experimental beat journey ranging a variety of BPM's. \nWe discussed a bit of his background and really got into the history of Low End Theory and the progression of where it is today. \nNobody discussed crucial experiences that you would want to know so listen closely. \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10811,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-10-05T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":3}},{"id":"SKEtz7QrvpE","position":24,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Michael Jackson - Remember The Time (Louis La Roche Remix)","track":{"id":"3nm8ofskdXs","path":"/artists/michael-jackson/tracks/remember-the-time-louis-la-roche-remix/","slug":"remember-the-time-louis-la-roche-remix","title":"Remember The Time (Louis La Roche Remix)","artist":{"slug":"michael-jackson","title":"Michael Jackson"},"artwork":"images/artists/michael-jackson/tracks/remember-the-time-louis-la-roche-remix.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"UMjXwUAv27s","slug":"148","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-148"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #148","artwork":"/images/episodes/148.jpg","content":"\nContinuing Joe Kay's 24th birthday celibration with precise selections that you either forgot about or never heard.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nIn celebration of Joe's 24th birthday yesterday, we started celebrating on Thursday at The Sound of Tomorrow (The Crosby) with Astronautica & starRo! Thank you to everyone who came out and supported, what a show it was. This radio session is just a continuation of the celebration with precise selections that you either forgot about or never heard. \nBless to those who tuned into the live broadcast via Kbeach. It's amazing to think about how far we've came. \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10830,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-10-12T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"Dwtr0hMEDaE","position":19,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Michael Jackson - Remember The Time (Louis La Roche Remix)","track":{"id":"3nm8ofskdXs","path":"/artists/michael-jackson/tracks/remember-the-time-louis-la-roche-remix/","slug":"remember-the-time-louis-la-roche-remix","title":"Remember The Time (Louis La Roche Remix)","artist":{"slug":"michael-jackson","title":"Michael Jackson"},"artwork":"images/artists/michael-jackson/tracks/remember-the-time-louis-la-roche-remix.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"A-2xaCFrXnk","slug":"150","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-150-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #150 w/ SOSUPERSAM","artwork":"/images/episodes/150.jpg","content":"Talented & vibrant woman SOSUPERSAM finally came through the studio. \n\n<!--more-->\nIt's been a long time coming and we're happy that you finally get a feel for who she is musically and as a person. Wasn't quite sure what she was gonna play for us, but she showed a great diversity and really brought us back to a place that was very much needed towards the end of her set. She's even cooler as a person. Being humble and driven will always get you far. Joe Kay really brought out a diverse selection of music. \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10814,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-11-02T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"1B8CK7vRIX4","position":52,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Michael Jackson - Butterflies (Acapella)","track":{"id":"zg1mp26iYSc","path":"/artists/michael-jackson/tracks/butterflies-acapella/","slug":"butterflies-acapella","title":"Butterflies (Acapella)","artist":{"slug":"michael-jackson","title":"Michael Jackson"},"artwork":"images/artists/michael-jackson/tracks/butterflies-acapella.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"-o3R3MpGKew","slug":"175","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-175-special-announcement"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #175 (Rinse FM Announ